BeStAddress — official address registers of Brussels-Capital, Flanders and Wallonia, consolidated and distributed by FPS BOSA DG Simplification and Digitalisation.
Source: https://opendata.bosa.be/index.fr.html
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
This corpus samples and reformats the official CSV exports; it is not an unmodified official publication. Floor/box forms test building recovery, not apartment identity. No IGN noncommercial derivative is used.
